# Keep the build context to the sources the image actually needs.
#
# This is not just an optimisation: without it, `COPY ./CentFlow/ ./` copies the
# host's node_modules over the Linux node_modules that `pnpm install` just
# created, which makes `pnpm run build` fail.
#
# node_modules alone is ~321 MB of a ~342 MB context, so ignoring it also removes
# almost all of the context transfer on every build.

# Dependency trees and build caches
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.angular
**/dist
**/www

# Version control and editor state
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.editorconfig

# Docs, tests and stray artifacts
**/*.md
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
